What this licence covers: the addon's code and its own pictures (the Media
folder), all of which were written and drawn for it.

The map data in the folders PatchwerkForever_Thread_Routes_Kalimdor,
PatchwerkForever_Thread_Routes_EasternKingdoms and
PatchwerkForever_Thread_Routes_ZephrasIsle was worked out from World of Warcraft's
own game files (the lie of the land, buildings, flight paths). World of
Warcraft and its game data belong to Blizzard Entertainment. Nothing in this
addon was taken from another addon.
